# stairwell: the stairwell's echoing near-silence, fourteen seconds
# looping: a faint warm pad on a low C and its fifth, a thread of air of
# a quiet seashore patch high up, both struck at 0 and 7 seconds on
# alternating channels so the loop's seam is the same join as the one
# inside, two kalimba drips each echoing twice, and a far-off door, a
# faint side-stick latch then a soft low taiko thud with one echo.
